      "text": "These modules use the same processing engine as the Crusher and Mixer: inputs from the **input** lane (and a reservoir when the recipe needs a fluid), RF every tick, all products delivered at once. Every recipe is datapack JSON (type *fieldframe:process* with a *family*), so packs can add, change or remove any of them."
